        \ {8.45, \ 4.7}, \ {11.5, \ 9.6}, \ {13.8, \ 7.3}, \n\ {12.9, \ 3.1}, 
        \ {11, \ 1.1}}; \nDiagramPlot[data2D]\)}], "Input"],

